    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Gilligan are delighted to present this magnificent four-bedroom detached residence located at Hazelhill, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo. Extending to approximately 3444 sq.ft. and set on a mature 0.59 acre site, this substantial family home has been finished to an exceptionally high standard throughout. Ideally located just a short distance from Ballyhaunis town centre, the property enjoys the perfect balance of peaceful residential living while remaining within easy reach of all local amenities.\r\n\r\nA truly impressive and spacious entrance hallway creates an immediate sense of grandeur on entering the property.  A striking staircase rises to a magnificent galleried landing overlooking the hall below, while the vaulted timber-clad ceiling and rooflight enhance the wonderful sense of space and natural light.  An elegant feature chandelier, decorative glazed doors and recessed lighting complete this beautifully presented and welcoming entrance. The first-floor galleried landing is equally impressive, with its open balustrade overlooking the entrance hall and highlighting the exceptional height and architectural character of this beautiful home. A fully fitted kitchen with island unit, a sold fuel stove in the living room, French doors lead from the sitting room to a back veranda. To complete the ground floor there is a bedroom with a fully tiled ensuite.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor there are three generous bedrooms. The master bedroom has a large walk-in wardrobe and fully tiled ensuite. The remaining two bedrooms have the convenience of a shared Jack & Jill Ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. To the rear of the property there is a detached garage incorporating an overhead Gym, tastefully landscaped gardens with mature trees and shrubbery, a rear patio area perfect for entertaining, tarmacadam driveway, oil-fired central heating, double glazed PVC windows and doors.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional home offers luxury, space and comfort in a highly desirable location, and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.46m x 4.86m \r\nCarpeted flooring, large open space with fully vaulted ceiling, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nSitting Room//Games Room - 6.0m x 5.353m \r\nTimber flooring, spotlights to ceiling, French Doors to hallway, French Doors to back veranda, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living room - 8.62m x 5.22m \r\n(Kitchen Area - 5.209 x 3.92)\nFully fitted kitchen with laminate work top, integrated cooker, extractor fan, American Style fridge freezer, dishwasher, tiled flooring and splash back area, breakfast bar with sink, pantry.\n\n(Living Room Area - 5.2 x 4.83)\nSolid oak timber flooring, double doors to entrance hallway, large windows, spotlights to ceiling, fireplace with timber and marble surround, large stove, fitted bookshelves, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 7.543m x 4.734m \r\nTiled flooring, spotlights to ceiling, 2 radiators.\r\n\r\nBack Hallway - 2.1m x 2.1m \r\nTiled flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.138m x 2.126m \r\nTiled flooring, fitted units, plumbed for washing machine & dryer, sink, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom - 4.359m x 3.476m \r\nTimber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 1.9m x 1.816m \r\nTimber flooring, wc., wash hand basin, shower, tiled splash back, 1 radiator.\n(Ensuite measurement included in bedroom measurements)\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 2.255m x 1.748m \r\nTimber flooring, wc., wash hand basin, spotlights to ceiling, walls semi-panelled, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBack Veranda - 7.79m x 3.4m \r\nDecked area to the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 5.373m x 5.326m \r\nTimber flooring, dual aspect windows, fully shelved walk-in wardrobe, (4.425 x 2.596), 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 4.286m x 2.326m \r\nFully tiled, wet room shower, wc., wash hand basin with vanity unit, bath, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 5.18m x 3.937m \r\nCarpeted flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.746m x 4.213m \r\nCarpeted flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nJack & Jill Walk-in Wardrobe - 3.53m x 2.413m \r\nCarpeted flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nJack & Jill  Ensuite - 3.516m x 1.819m \r\nFully  tiled, wc., wash hand basin with vanity unit, large double shower, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nOffice - 3.8m x 3.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nHot Press - 2.46m x 1.11m \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 6.6m x 5.4m \r\nGarage includes an overhead Gym (6.6 x 5.4)\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Magnificent four-bedroom detached residence extending to circa 3444 sq,ft,\r\nFinished to an exceptionally high standard throughout.\r\nAn impressive and spacious entrance hallway with vaulted ceiling.\r\nFully fitted kitchen with island unit.\r\nSolid fuel stove in the living room.\r\nGround floor bedroom with ensuite.\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\n2 bedrooms with a shared Jack & Jill Ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\nDetached garage with overhead Gym.\r\nLandscaped gardens with mature trees and shrubbery.\r\nPatio area to the rear, perfect for entertaining.\r\nTarmacadam Driveway"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
